      "message": "I\u0027m not sure how much this matters right now since I can\u0027t seem to find a way to disable the display via the UI. But using ectool to exit DP mode:\n\n$ ectool pdsetmode 1 0xff01 1  0\n[698.437973 hc_remote_pd_set_amode: PD exit mode]\n[698.438429 pd_dfp_exit_mode: Normal exit!]\nsvdm_exit_dp_mode: port: 1\n[698.440643 usb/dp mux: p_mux(0) usb2(0) polarity(0)]\n[698.442887 hc_remote_pd_set_amode: Sending CMD_EXIT]\n[698.457900 ACK EXIT MODE]\n\nIt leaves the mux disconnected. I would imagine we would need a post_exit that sets the mux to USB for this to function correctly.\n\nIdeally if we were in DOCK and an exit was issued we would change the mux to USB.",
